      "note": "GTFS-Realtime is the format most of the world's bus agencies publish, so the layer carries a small protobuf reader for it rather than a per-agency adapter: any agency that publishes a keyless VehiclePositions URL can be added here with adapter \"gtfsrt\" and no new code. Positions are the agency's own; ones older than ten minutes are dropped. The bundled static GTFS extract supplies line geometry and station dots; its refresh workflow only retains public routes, shapes and stops.",
